license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/RAFAELDCOELHO/PersonaCore"
url: "https://github.com/RAFAELDCOELHO/PersonaCore"
abstract: >-
  PersonaCore is a from-scratch, on-device research system for studying
  parametric personalization. The project therefore studies both the
  capabilities and the privacy costs of weight-based memory, including a
  subsequent adversarial audit of extraction from LoRA weights.
keywords:
  - from-scratch
  - on-device
  - GPT
  - parametric personalization
  - LoRA
  - weight-based memory
  - adversarial audit
  - privacy
  - PyTorch
date-released: 2026-06-10
